---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy — StreakGrid"
  description="How StreakGrid protects your personal tracking data and financial transaction history."
>
  <div class="legal-page-layout">
    <header class="legal-header">
      <div class="legal-header-inner">
        <a href="/" class="brand-link">
          <div class="brand-badge">✓</div>
          <span class="brand-name">StreakGrid</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/" class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm">Return Home</a>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main class="legal-content-container">
      <div class="legal-doc-card">
        <div class="doc-header">
          <span class="doc-tag">Privacy & Security</span>
          <h1 class="doc-title">Privacy Policy</h1>
          <span class="doc-date">Effective Date: September 2026</span>
        </div>

        <div class="doc-body">
          <section class="doc-section">
            <h2>1. Our Privacy First Principle</h2>
            <p>
              Your challenge tracking data is completely private by default. Challenges are never broadcast to the community or published online unless you explicitly choose to toggle visibility to <em>Community</em> or <em>Public</em>.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section class="doc-section">
            <h2>2. Financial Data & Security</h2>
            <p>
              StreakGrid does <strong>never</strong> store raw credit card numbers, bank credentials, or CVVs on our servers. All monetary transactions are processed through certified, PCI-DSS-compliant payment providers via encrypted tokenization.
            </p>
            <p>
              We maintain an immutable ledger of transaction IDs, currency, and amount records strictly for audit verification, fraud prevention, and accounting transparency.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section class="doc-section">
            <h2>3. Information We Collect</h2>
            <ul>
              <li><strong>Account Info:</strong> Name, email address, password hash (salted using scrypt).</li>
              <li><strong>Challenge Tracking:</strong> Challenge names, activities, daily statuses (completed, missed, pending, exempt), and optional cell notes.</li>
              <li><strong>Stakes & Verification:</strong> Escrow commitment references, proof links submitted by you, and dispute documentation.</li>
            </ul>
          </section>

          <section class="doc-section">
            <h2>4. Public Controls & Disclosures</h2>
            <p>
              Even on publicly shared challenges, you have full control to hide or display your exact stake commitment amount. You may disable comments at any time from your challenge settings.
            </p>
          </section>
        </div>
      </div>
    </main>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal-page-layout {
    min-height: 100vh;
    background: var(--color-bg);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .legal-header {
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    padding: 12px 20px;
  }

  .legal-header-inner {
    max-width: 860px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }

  .brand-link {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 16px;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .brand-badge {
    width: 24px;
    height: 24px;
    background: var(--color-primary);
    border-radius: 5px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    color: #FFFFFF;
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 14px;
  }

  .legal-content-container {
    max-width: 860px;
    width: 100%;
    margin: 30px auto 80px auto;
    padding: 0 20px;
  }

  .legal-doc-card {
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-modal);
    padding: 40px 36px;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 28px;
  }

  .doc-header {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 6px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle);
    padding-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .doc-tag {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-primary-hover);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  }

  .doc-title {
    font-size: 28px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--color-text);
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .doc-date {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--color-muted);
  }

  .doc-body {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 24px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .doc-section {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .doc-section h2 {
    font-size: 17px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .doc-section ul {
    margin-left: 20px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 6px;
  }
</style>
